==Battleground==
*1 [[Wicked Face]] spawns after 0.07 seconds<sup>2f</sup>.
*1 [[Teacher Bun Bun]] spawns after 10 seconds<sup>300f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 99% HP:
**1 [[Manic Jamiera Cat (Enemy)|Manic Jamiera Cat]] spawns as the boss.
**Infinite [[Doge Dark]]s spawn, delay 26.67~33.33 seconds<sup>800f~1,000f</sup>.
**Infinite [[Sinner Snache]]s spawn, delay 26.67~33.33 seconds<sup>800f~1,000f</sup>.
**6 [[Aku Gory|Aku Gories]] spawn, delay 30~33.33 seconds<sup>900f~1,000f</sup>.
**1 [[Li'l Nyandam (Enemy)|Li'l Nyandam]] spawns.

==Strategy==
Stall out the Wicked Face and Bun Bun combo at the start to build up money, then hit the base. Manic Jamiera Cat isn't too bad to deal with, and similar counters you used on the original Floor 37 do fine here. The main problem, as per usual, is Aku Gory. Immediately remove him before he does too much using counters like [[Hip Hop Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Can Can Cat]] or [[Weightlifter Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Pizza Cat]]. In between Aku Gories, try to find opportunities to chip down Manic Jamiera, owning to his large health.

